@startuml activity-wf3-zone-access-granting
' Title: AD-WF3 Zone Access Granting (WF-3, owner Nguyen Anh Hao)
' Source (main @ 45076c9): service/AccessRequestService.java (create; review only before the start time and not by the requester;
'   expire, finish, cancel), service/AreaAssignedPersonnelService.java, service/AreaService.java + scheduler/AreaEventModeScheduler.java
'   (event start or FAILED), service/GuestVisitService.java (host cannot review own visit), service/GuestPhotoService.java,
'   service/AccessDecisionService.java (checkCameraEntry), ai-service (check-entry call, alert)
' Business level only. Detailed flows: activity-access-request.mmd, activity-event-schedule.mmd, activity-guest-visit.mmd.
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #1F2937
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7E6
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
title AD-WF3 — Zone Access Granting

|Authorized User|
|Facility Manager|
|Administrator|
|System|
|Facility Manager|
start
if (Access source?) then (access request)
  |Authorized User|
  :Request access for a time window
  (alone or with members);
  |Facility Manager|
  :Approve or reject before the start time
  (not one's own request);
elseif () then (named assignment)
  |Facility Manager|
  :Assign a named person to the area
  for one validity window;
elseif () then (event)
  |Facility Manager|
  :Schedule an event
  on a Confidential area;
else (guest visit)
  |Authorized User|
  :Host invites guests
  to Confidential areas;
  |Facility Manager|
  :Another Facility Manager
  approves or rejects the visit;
  |Administrator|
  :Attach each approved guest's photo
  after recording consent;
endif
|System|
:Record the grant and notify the people concerned:
request Approved, Rejected or Expired,
assignment Upcoming or Active,
event Started or Failed at its start time,
visit Approved or Rejected;
if (Grant in force?) then (no)
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:A recognised person reaches a camera of the area;
note right: The AI Surveillance Engine recognises\nthe person and asks whether entry is allowed.
if (A valid access source covers this person now?) then (yes)
  :Record the entry as authorised;
else (no)
  :Record the entry as denied,
  create a security incident and alert the guards;
endif
:Close the grant: request Finished or Cancelled,
assignment Expired or Revoked,
event Completed or Ended early,
visit Completed, Cancelled or Revoked;
stop
@enduml
